webdoc (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Provides the web command, the .web format version 1, and desktop MIME
    integration for application/x-webdoc.
  * The browser launched by `web open` is always fully detached from the
    calling terminal, so it can neither write to the terminal after web has
    exited nor hold it open.
  * Verbose mode (-v, --verbose) reports each step of an operation on
    standard error, leaving standard output free for results.
  * `web show` prints a single document; `web list` enumerates a directory.
  * `web variables` lists the defined variables; `web config` reports the
    global configuration state.

 -- Sivaprasad Murali <sivaprasad.off@gmail.com>  Wed, 16 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
